text:
Maria Chen: Quick sync — planning a micro-launch for the Prompt Templates webinar + credit experiment. Hypothesis: gated 50 credits tied to webinar signups will produce higher 7-day activation than open 200 credits. Need copy, landing, webinar invite, routing for inbound, and an A/B for onboarding nudge. :rocket:

Ajay Patel: +1. Recommend two cohorts: GATED (50 credits + required webinar RSVP) vs OPEN (200 credits immediate). Metrics: sign-to-activation % (7d), avg tokens/day, retention 14d. Also add a 'did the user open prompt template' event.

Sophia Gomez: I can draft email + webinar landing copy. Can we finalize webinar title? Suggest "Prompt Templates: Build Fast, Ship Smarter". Also need slides + 3 quick demos.

Leo Park: Routing: inbound leads should hit #sales-inbound and tag with experiment param. I can add a Zap/flow to tag with `exp=prompt_gated_v_open`. Also add the support tag for hot leads.

GrowthBot: Experiment created: exp_id=exp_2024_11_prompt_gated_open — dashboard scaffold at https://growth.internal/exp/exp_2024_11 (placeholder). :chart_with_upwards_trend:

Maria Chen: Great. Assigning: Sophia - copy + slides + webinar ops; Ajay - experiment config + analytics; Leo - routing & Zap; I'll own benchmark narrative + comms. Target: launch cohort 2-week test starting Mon 2024-05-06. Can everyone confirm capacity?

Ajay Patel: Need cohort sizes. Recommend 1k new users per arm or 2 weeks whichever first. Is that feasible?

Maria Chen: Yes. Set goal: min 800 per arm. If we under-index, extend by 1 week.

Sophia Gomez: Drafting email + in-app nudge. In-app nudge copy (short):

"Hey — try our new Prompt Templates. Use your starter credits to get a template to ship in minutes. [Open templates]"

Also propose a second in-app flow for gated cohort: "Claim 50 webinar credits after RSVP" CTA.

Leo Park: Routing config (snippet):

```
if (utm.exp === 'prompt_gated') {
  tag('experiment', 'prompt_gated');
  routeTo('#sales-inbound', priority='high');
} else {
  tag('experiment', 'prompt_open');
  routeTo('#growth-inbound', priority='normal');
}
```

I'll push to staging today.

Maria Chen: Nice. Please post doc links when ready. Sophia — can you add the deck + email copy to this doc? https://docs.redwood/team/marketing/prompt-webinar (add comments). Appreciate quick turn.

Sophia Gomez: Will do. Putting first draft by EOD. :calendar:

Ajay Patel: I'll wire up events and a quick look ML eval for template usage. Ping me if you want custom metrics in the dashboard.

Maria Chen: Perfect — thanks team. We'll review mock numbers in tomorrow's 10am sync. :thumbsup:
